  "brief": "[Instrukt Assignment]\nRun `instrukt docs get crew/procedure/plan --closure` and execute that procedure.\n\nslug: native-fallback\n$ARGUMENTS: native-fallback\n\nRetain this original brief.\n[/Instrukt Assignment]\n[Instrukt Assignment]\nResolved role capabilities: role: planner; class: agent; grants: docs-read:any, docs-write:any, todo-read:any, todo-write:any, bug-report:any, artifact-read:any, artifact-write:any, stamp:any, todo-orchestration:any, assignment-write:any, integration:any, session-observe:any, history-read:any, standing-bind:any, conversation-link:any, agents-read:any, agents-write:any, config-read:any, config-write:any, secrets-write:any, repository-read:any, repository-write:any, code-commit:any, publication:any, code-check:any, eval-read:any, events-read:any, installation-read:any, installation-write:any, runner-execute:any, mcp-access:any, company-reply:any\nAssignment scope: the fixed todo, home and workspace evidence supplied with this assignment. Object claims, phase and writer constraints apply.\n[/Instrukt Assignment]",
